%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> BASELINE: Operator clicks Start Baseline
    BASELINE --> BASELINE_DONE: 120 seconds elapsed<br/>Averages, sigma, thresholds locked
    BASELINE_DONE --> LIVE: Operator clicks Start Live Session
    LIVE --> STOPPED: Operator clicks Stop
    STOPPED --> LIVE: Operator clicks Start Live again<br/>(rotates CSV, same baseline)
    STOPPED --> [*]: Operator closes dashboard

    note right of BASELINE
        No telemetry from Unity yet.
        Physiology rows buffer in memory.
    end note

    note right of BASELINE_DONE
        metadata.json written with
        frozen baseline + thresholds.
    end note

    note right of LIVE
        Fusion active.
        UDP commands flow to Unity.
        First telemetry packet
        commits the CSV header.
    end note
